Closed/wall compactification note:
  S512/S520 source menus include equality-wall witnesses.  The open
  Ferrers tournament menu gives 1,2,4,6,10 classes for n=4..8, while
  stored closed/wall speed menus report 2,2,6,6,>=12.  The surplus
  classes are boundary/tie-path data, not raw open A000568 classes.

